<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.1//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml11/DTD/xhtml11.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="ko"><head><title>[TreeView] 초기 로딩 시 지정 depth까지 노드 자동 확장하기</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/book.css" type="text/css" /><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="application/xhtml+xml; charset=utf-8" /><meta name="EPB-UUID" content="f1fbcef72ff0a2ec" /></head><body><div class="chapter_content"><h1 id="r_f447cd83c6361d99" class="chapter_title">[TreeView] 초기 로딩 시 지정 depth까지 노드 자동 확장하기</h1><h1 id="r_d1df3135cd9a4e66" class="element heading1" data-element-id="d1df3135cd9a4e66"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">1</span><span>개요</span></div></h1><pre id="r_23fab2b4da340b79" class="element pre" data-element-id="23fab2b4da340b79">Treeview의 'showTreeDepth' 속성을 사용하여 초기 로딩시 확장되어 보여질 노드의 depth값을 설정하는 예제입니다.</pre><p id="r_263ae91a279ed7e0" class="element r_example_link_p" data-element-id="263ae91a279ed7e0"><a class="link" href="http://example.websquare.kr/link.html?p=P00458">P00458</a></p><h1 id="r_68915d15e6d32681" class="element heading1" data-element-id="68915d15e6d32681"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">2</span><span>구현된 기능</span></div></h1><ul id="r_61ab6a2ae4da6d93" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="61ab6a2ae4da6d93"><li><p>showTreeDepth 미적용</p></li><li><p>showTreeDepth 적용</p></li></ul><h1 id="r_fa2a73ac11ea27a6" class="element heading1" data-element-id="fa2a73ac11ea27a6"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">3</span><span>예제 테스트 방법</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_c81b174a3b8fa7b3" class="element heading2" data-element-id="c81b174a3b8fa7b3"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.1</span><span>showTreeDepth 미적용</span></div></h2><div id="r_370f873b3bd60771" class="element step1" data-element-id="370f873b3bd60771"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>STEP 1: 결과를 확인합니다.</p></div><pre id="r_62a6da9e18a12358" class="element pre step1_indent" data-element-id="62a6da9e18a12358">모든 노드가 펼쳐져 있는 것을 확인합니다.</pre><div id="r_875de5da68489ff1" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="875de5da68489ff1"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 1.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image1527.png" width="188" height="217" /></p></div><h2 id="r_b6a37a9bac50dbd7" class="element heading2" data-element-id="b6a37a9bac50dbd7"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.2</span><span>showTreeDepth 적용</span></div></h2><div id="r_ad8bd0da0e40a137" class="element step1" data-element-id="ad8bd0da0e40a137"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>STEP 1: 결과를 확인합니다.</p></div><pre id="r_e20c9409130c3560" class="element pre step1_indent" data-element-id="e20c9409130c3560">가장 상위 노드까지만 보이는 것을 확인합니다.</pre><div id="r_89a55f40ba6fb89b" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="89a55f40ba6fb89b"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 2.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image1528.png" width="187" height="137" /></p></div><h1 id="r_b7f3e60a33ecfe39" class="element heading1" data-element-id="b7f3e60a33ecfe39"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">4</span><span>구현 예시</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_b7ef75f1acb3b12d" class="element heading2" data-element-id="b7ef75f1acb3b12d"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">4.1</span><span>showTreeDepth 적용</span></div></h2><div id="r_c91f2e24ee1a76d0" class="element step1" data-element-id="c91f2e24ee1a76d0"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>Treeview의 속성을 정의합니다.</p></div><ul id="r_30a5eca4286cf5bd" class="element unordered_list step1_indent" data-element-id="30a5eca4286cf5bd"><li><p><span class="r_blue001_span">[필수] showTreeDepth="depth값"</span></p><p>(옵션 설명)</p><p>초기 로딩시 확장되어 보여질 노드의 depth값을 숫자로 입력한다.</p></li></ul><div id="r_71b6af4e728b2ab5" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="71b6af4e728b2ab5"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 3.</span>웹스퀘어 스튜디오의 Component View 예시 - depth값 추가</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image1529.png" width="364" height="165" /></p></div><div id="r_7d1a915daff6da41" class="element code support_code_numbering step1_indent" data-element-id="7d1a915daff6da41"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 1.</span>Source</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">&lt;!-- Treeview 의 소스 본문 예시 --&gt;</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&lt;w2:treeview <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">showTreeDepth</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"0"</span>&gt;
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_comment_span">&lt;!-- 중략 --&gt;</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&lt;/w2:treeview&gt;</pre></div><h1 id="r_4378a6f354605b09" class="element heading1" data-element-id="4378a6f354605b09"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">5</span><span>주요 API</span></div></h1><ul id="r_3751800f77dc6e45" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="3751800f77dc6e45"><li><p><span class="r_ex_api_property_span">showTreeDepth </span></p></li></ul></div></body></html>